# Dragon Magazine Compendium - features of those substitution levels (subst_build.py).


###Block: Aasimar Incarnate substitution levels
Aasimar Incarnate	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:Aasimar incarnates who strike true against the forces of evil. Requirements: a neutral good aasimar about to take the 1st, 3rd or 7th incarnate level.
Martial Weapon	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Martial Weapon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:He selects any martial melee weapon (usually the warhammer, the weapon of the good incarnate weapon soulmeld) and gains Martial Weapon Proficiency and Weapon Focus with it (choose by hand). Replaces nothing.
Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:While his incarnum radiance is active his natural and weapon attacks count as good-aligned against damage reduction, and an incarnate weapon soulmeld deals +1d6 damage to creatures of the evil subtype (not shared with allies). Augments incarnum radiance.
Share Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Share Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:He can share his incarnum radiance with any nonevil ally (not only good allies), chosen when it is activated, but not the good alignment of his attacks. Augments share incarnum radiance.

###Block: Gnome Incarnate substitution levels
Gnome Incarnate	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Gnome incarnates defending their villages. Requirements: a neutral good gnome about to take the 1st, 2nd or 7th incarnate level.
Racial Defense	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Racial Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:An insight bonus on damage rolls against kobolds, goblinoids and giants equal to half the number of soulmelds he has shaped (the full number with another gnome ally visible within 30 feet). Replaces detect opposition.
Detect Thoughts	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Detect Thoughts	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While a soulmeld is bound to his crown chakra he can use detect thoughts once per day (save DC 12 + Charisma modifier, caster level = meldshaper level). Replaces nothing.
Share Incarnum Radiance (Gnome)	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Share Incarnum Radiance (Gnome)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Allies sharing his incarnum radiance also gain a +4 dodge bonus to AC against giants (not stacking with a racial dodge bonus against giants). Augments share incarnum radiance.

###Block: Tiefling Incarnate substitution levels
Tiefling Incarnate	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Tiefling incarnates mingling mortal souls with fiendish minds. Requirements: a neutral evil tiefling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 7th incarnate level. Class skills: the incarnate's plus Bluff and Hide; 4 + Int skill points (by hand).
See in Darkness	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ See in Darkness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:With a shaped soulmeld occupying her brow chakra she sees normally in magical darkness (such as a darkness spell). Replaces nothing.
Incarnum Radiance (Tiefling)	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Incarnum Radiance (Tiefling)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While not in bright illumination she has concealment (20%% miss chance) even against creatures that see normally in such conditions. Augments incarnum radiance.
Telepathy	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Telepathy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While a soulmeld is bound to her crown chakra she can communicate telepathically with any creature with a language within 100 feet. Replaces share incarnum radiance.
